msgid ""
"**Version bump** that updates OpenMV IDE to 1.7.1 with no functional changes"
" (`3316d25f8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3316d25f8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Actualizare de versiune** care actualizează OpenMV IDE la 1.7.1 fără "
"modificări funcționale (\\ `3316d25f8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3316d25f8>`__\\ )."

